{"data": [{"author_id": "1988454162057826304", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:24:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845602584612891"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/SkRV6CJubp", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2114845602584612891/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114845470950662145", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/SkRV6CJubp"}]}, "id": "2114845602584612891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 750, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "TSMC REPORTEDLY EYES UP TO 20% CoWoS PRICE HIKE AS AI CHIP DEMAND SURGES (TW MEDIA)\n\nTSMC is reportedly considering another round of CoWoS price increases of up to 20%, as demand for advanced packaging continues to outpace available capacity.\n\nSupply-chain sources say customers https://t.co/SkRV6CJubp", "url": "https://x.com/antfeedapp/status/2114845602584612891"}, {"author_id": "1730565937831538688", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:13:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114797674767512044"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 11, "start": 7, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ogKXktqyPH", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CaktusJxck/status/2114797674767512044/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114797670220873728", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/ogKXktqyPH"}]}, "id": "2114797674767512044", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 807, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC ( $TSM ) is reportedly preparing to raise CoWoS advanced packaging prices by 10–20% as surging AI chip demand tightens capacity, extends delivery times and accelerates expansion plans, according to Taiwan’s Commercial Times.\n\n•Demand:\nAI GPUs, server CPUs and custom ASICs https://t.co/ogKXktqyPH", "url": "https://x.com/CaktusJxck/status/2114797674767512044"}, {"author_id": "301460017", "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:46:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": [