"start": 165, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Leoskie_L/stat…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Leoskie_L/status/2114378957575299158", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/jwNPx1yxU4"}]}, "id": "2114690733076828329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114378957575299158", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Samsung passing SK hynix in HBM revenue is a Bernstein estimate built from export data, not a disclosure.\nThe Taiwan stake: SK hynix's HBM4 base die is made on TSMC $TSM logic, while Samsung makes its own. A Samsung share gain is a small loss for TSMC, even if the stacks still https://t.co/jwNPx1yxU4", "url": "https://x.com/BlueyLensTW/status/2114690733076828329"}, {"author_id": "1468091726640611330", "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:37:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114909428839584067"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "法人估台積電先進封裝擴產與技術時程AI晶片搶產能，先進封裝醞釀漲價。供應鏈透露，台積電CoWoS報價醞釀新一波調漲，漲幅上看2成，部分封裝交期已拉長，產能吃緊壓力持續升高。搶產能效應同步延燒設備端，業者直言，客戶已無暇砍價，只要能承諾交期便下單，設備交期最長拉至八個月，供應鏈全面拚交貨、拚擴產。 先...", "display_url": "ctee.com.tw/news/202610277…", "end": 74, "expanded_url": "https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20261027700053-439901", "images": [{"height": 682, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114797112596606977/uAmJ88w4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114797112596606977/uAmJ88w4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 51, "status": 200, "title": "台積CoWoS傳喊漲上看2成", "unwound_url": "https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20261027700053-439901", "url": "https://t.co/2S9pvdyg8e"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/brYchmsx51", "end": 228, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/1pick____/status/2114909428839584067/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114909422241845249", "start": 205, "url": "https://t.co/brYchmsx51"}, {"display_url": "x.com/1pick____/stat…", "end": 252, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/1pick____/status/2107770248476926322", "start": 229, "url": "https://t.co/BN7a2bUcaL"}]}, "id": "2114909428839584067", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2107770248476926322", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "💻 TSMC, CoWoS 패키징 가격 최대 20% 인상 추진…AI 반도체 공급 부족 심화\n\nhttps://t.co/2S9pvdyg8e\n\n📌 CoWoS 가격 10~20% 인상 가능성\nAI GPU뿐 아니라 서버 CPU, 맞춤형 ASIC까지 첨단 패키징 수요 확대\n\nTSMC 및 OSAT 업체들, CoWoS 가격 10~20% 인상 검토\n\n패키징·테스트 병목 심화로 공급자 https://t.co/brYchmsx51 https://t.co/BN7a2bUcaL", "url": "https://x.com/1pick____/status/2114909428839584067"}, {"author_id": "1480746975435771905", "created_at": "2026-10-27T06:32:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114968452435984887"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Wi8MU2YKtc", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MojoTricks/status/2114968452435984887/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114968438041182208", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/Wi8MU2YKtc"}]}, "id": "2114968452435984887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 396, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is reportedly preparing to raise prices for its CoWoS advanced packaging services by as much as 20%, according to Taiwanese media reports. \n\nThe technology is critical for high-performance AI chips, connecting GPUs or other processors with high-bandwidth memory (HBM). https://t.co/Wi8MU2YKtc", "url": "https://x.com/MojoTricks/status/2114968452435984887"}, {"author_id": "499022116", "created_at": "2026-10-27T18:57:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115156029675880762"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/D9A62rkeG3", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/abnabdullah5/status/2115156029675880762/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115156015318532096", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/D9A62rkeG3"}]}, "id": "2115156029675880762", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 368, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "تدرس شركة تي إس إم سي رفع أسعار تقنية التغليف المتقدمة CoWoS بنسبة قد تصل إلى 20%، في ظل الطلب المتسارع على معالجات الذكاء الاصطناعي والدوائر المتخصصة ASIC، وهو ما يضع ضغوطًا متزايدة على قدرات الإنتاج وسلاسل التوريد. وتشير تقارير إلى أن تعقيد تصميم الرقائق الحديثة ودمج المزيد من https://t.co/D9A62rkeG3", "url": "https://x.com/abnabdullah5/status/2115156029675880762"}, {"author_id": "148936861", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114930088114360655"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "반도체"}, {"end": 50, "start": 44, "tag": "반도체장비"}, {"end": 56, "start": 51, "tag": "ASML"}, {"end": 62, "start": 57, "tag": "네덜란드"}, {"end": 68, "start": 63, "tag": "노광장비"}, {"end": 74, "start": 69, "tag": "삼성전자"}, {"end": 82, "start": 75, "tag": "SK하이닉스"}, {"end": 88, "start": 83, "tag": "TSMC"}, {"end": 93, "start": 89, "tag": "HBM"}, {"end": 100, "start": 94, "tag": "반도체패권"}], "urls": [{"description": "인공지능(AI) 반도체 수요가 급증하면서 네덜란드 반도체 장비업체 ASML의 경제적 영향력이 커지고 있다. 올해 ASML이 네덜란드 경제에서 직접 차지하는 비중은 1.6%에 이를 것으로 전망된다. 반도체 장비업체 한 곳에 국가 경제가 지나치게 의존할 수 있다는 우려도 나온다.26일(현", "display_url": "it.chosun.com/news/articleVi…", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://it.chosun.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=2023092172845&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=sns&utm_campaign=itchosun", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114930108670603264/rEnYYLiL?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 589}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114930108670603264/rEnYYLiL?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 102, "status": 200, "title": "네덜란드 경제 1.6% 차지한 ASML", "unwound_url": "https://it.chosun.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=2023092172845&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=sns&utm_campaign=itchosun", "url": "https://t.co/IRkF7S1CN4"}]}, "id": "2114930088114360655", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#반도체 장비업체 한 곳에 국가 경제가 지나치게 의존할 수 있다는 우려 나와\n\n#반도체장비 #ASML #네덜란드 #노광장비 #삼성전자 #SK하이닉스 #TSMC #HBM #반도체패권\n\nhttps://t.co/IRkF7S1CN4", "url": "https://x.com/IT_CHOSUN/status/2114930088114360655"}, {"author_id": "2067640128105824256", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:00:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114930107706146978"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}, {"end": 255, "start": 250, "tag": "NVDA"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gFJIUcQLYC", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MelvinInvests/status/2114930107706146978/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114930105428688896", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/gFJIUcQLYC"}, {"display_url": "x.com/19839160158778…", "end": 328, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/1983916015877812224/status/2113526089066987564", "start": 305, "url": "https://t.co/k5gjHzoU0Y"}]}, "id": "2114930107706146978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 6545, "like_count": 74, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113526089066987564", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$TSM is reportedly getting ready to raise prices on CoWoS advanced packaging by up to 20%, according to Taiwanese media.\n\nCoWoS is the step that bonds the GPU to its HBM memory, and every major AI chip needs it.\n\nDemand is no longer coming only from $NVDA GPUs because Server CPUs https://t.co/gFJIUcQLYC https://t.co/k5gjHzoU0Y", "url": "https://x.com/MelvinInvests/status/2114930107706146978"}, {"author_id": "1336521079494303744", "created_at": "2026-10-27T04:30:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114937837678383462"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 116, "start": 112, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/q810IbIteA", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/babybluecream/status/2114937837678383462/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114937828656504