y up to 20%, according to supply chain reports. The case for higher prices rests on manufacturing complexity, yield, investment risk, and the cost of waiting. https://t.co/yYesM5UzGk", "url": "https://x.com/JulesNauy/status/2114923568022880564"}, {"author_id": "1874887449404448769", "created_at": "2026-10-26T11:03:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114674148844708008"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 19, "start": 15, "tag": "ASX"}]}, "id": "2114674148844708008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1550, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "今年以来算到10/23收盘， $ASX  涨了140.3%，$AMKR 跌了0.5%。\n\n同样是封装测试龙头，同样站在AI链条上，一家翻了一倍多，一家原地没动。\n\n这一篇讲产业链里的先进封装：$TSM 的CoWoS和SoIC，日月光（$ASX），$AMKR，再顺带设备和材料。\n\n封装这一步做什么。", "url": "https://x.com/youngstockuser/status/2114674148844708008"}, {"article": {"title": "How Much New AI Compute Comes Online in 2027? Backing It Out from NVIDIA's Revenue"}, "author_id": "1492675031054581760", "created_at": "2026-10-26T04:36:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114576801884492234"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2114…", "end": 144, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114572153463214080", "start": 121, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114572153463214080", "url": "https://t.co/6QIq226zyC"}]}, "id": "2114576801884492234", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 442, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "About 15 GW of new NVIDIA compute will be installed and actually powered on in 2027, with a reasonable range of 13–18 GW https://t.co/6QIq226zyC", "url": "https://x.com/y0usali/status/2114576801884492234"}, {"author_id": "1759276656143814656", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:44:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114790407460491580"], "id": "2114790407460491580", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply